{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Notation","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Complex.Basic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.multiplier_order_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.multiplier_order_four","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/VertexLocalTauModel.lean#L110-L117","doc":"The vertex multiplier is an honest order-4 unit: `i⁴ = 1`, `i² = −1` —\nthe #3942 4-cycle eigendata at scalar level over `ℂ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.shadow_unique_complex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.shadow_unique_complex","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/VertexLocalTauModel.lean#L97-L108","doc":"**Forced assignment over ℂ.** Any `f : ℂ → Bool` satisfying the\nnormalization `f i = true` and the ρ-intertwining `f (conj i) = ¬ f i`\nagrees with the forced Hodge-shadow assignment on the whole degenerate pair\n— the #3960 uniqueness transported from the GInt shadow to genuine `ℂ`\nconjugation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.hecke_relation_conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.hecke_relation_conj","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/VertexLocalTauModel.lean#L89-L95","doc":"The ρ-partner satisfies the conjugated Hecke relation (`q = −i`,\n`q − q⁻¹ = −2i`): `σ̄² = −2i·σ̄ + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.rho_carries_module","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.rho_carries_module","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/VertexLocalTauModel.lean#L80-L87","doc":"**ρ carries the `q = i` module to the `q = −i` module** — the genuinely\nANTI-LINEAR statement (entrywise `starRingEnd ℂ`) whose combinatorial mirror\nwas the GInt vertex-family swap (#3942). This is the analytic type B1\nidentified for the Hodge pairing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.not_semisimple","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.not_semisimple","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/VertexLocalTauModel.lean#L73-L78","doc":"Non-semisimplicity: `σ` is not the scalar `i·1` — the degenerate module\nhas genuine nilpotent content; only its SEMISIMPLIFICATION acts by `i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.jordan_nilpotent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.jordan_nilpotent","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/VertexLocalTauModel.lean#L66-L71","doc":"The degenerate confluence: `(σ − i·1)² = 0` — at `q = i` the two Hecke\neigenvalues `q, −q⁻¹` coincide and the module is a nontrivial Jordan block. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.hecke_relation_at_i","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.hecke_relation_at_i","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/VertexLocalTauModel.lean#L58-L64","doc":"`σ` satisfies the Hecke relation at `q = i` (`q − q⁻¹ = 2i`):\n`σ² = 2i·σ + 1`. The Jordan block IS an H₂(i)-module. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.sigmaBar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.sigmaBar","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/VertexLocalTauModel.lean#L55-L56","doc":"Its ρ-partner: the Jordan block at `q = −i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.sigma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.VertexLocalTauModel.sigma","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/VertexLocalTauModel.lean#L51-L53","doc":"The degenerate-locus Hecke generator at `q = i`: the 2×2 Jordan block\nwith eigenvalue `i`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}